@startuml nin-enrolment-activity
' NIMS 2.0 - NIN enrolment to issuance - main human and technical stakeholders only
' Rules are tagged; see models/nin-requirements.md. [A] = assumption to confirm.
|Resident|
start
:Arrive at enrolment centre with documents;
|Enrolment station (officer)|
:Capture demographics and documents
validated against ID schema and reference data [F-01];
:Capture fingerprints, irises, face
quality check, max 3 retries per modality [F-02][NF-02];
if (Quality reached?) then (no after retries)
  :Record biometric exception with photo [F-02];
endif
:Supervisor approval; print RID slip
session <= [15] min [A] [F-03][NF-01];
|Resident|
:Keep RID slip (proof of enrolment);
|Enrolment station (officer)|
while (Network to central platform?) is (down)
  :Queue encrypted packet locally
  (offline >= [72] h, no loss) [NF-03];
endwhile (up)
:Sync and upload packet [NF-03];
|Central platform (MOSIP)|
:Validate integrity, centre / machine / operator,
ID schema conformance [F-04];
if (Packet valid?) then (no)
  :Reject with reason; notify resident [F-04][F-09];
  stop
endif
|ABIS|
:Demographic and biometric deduplication [F-05];
if (Possible match?) then (yes)
  |Adjudicator|
  :Manual adjudication [F-06];
  if (Duplicate confirmed?) then (yes)
    |Central platform (MOSIP)|
    :Reject; no NIN consumed [F-06];
    stop
  endif
endif
|Central platform (MOSIP)|
:Assign exactly one NIN (11 digits, check digit) [A]
and one perpetual VID [F-07];
:Activate identity; issue credential
to verification partners [F-08];
note right
  RID -> NIN <= [24] h end-to-end
  for no-hit cases [A] [NF-04]
  Audit event per step [F-10]
  Signals per step, env/site tagged [NF-07][NF-08]
end note
|Messaging gateway|
:Send NIN by SMS and email in chosen language
within [15] min of issuance [A] [F-09][NF-05];
|Resident|
:Receive NIN;
stop
@enduml
